     rm.Load() from disk: AnnualAmount==100000, StartYear/EndYear==3/12 preserved, Enabled==true,
     and (e) an independent re-run of handleWhatIfConversionSweep also marks the $100,000 row
     current — proving a real save, not a render artifact.
   - TestConversionSweepApply_ZeroAmountDisablesConversion asserts the $0 apply persists
     AnnualAmount 0 with Enabled==false (the enabled = amount>0 rule).
